{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And you shall know</b> — then you shall know, if you do not listen to Me. Now He speaks with Israel, for they are obligated to honor the priests, the ministers of HaShem, and to do as they instruct you, and not to bring an offering that has a blemish."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:09.744966957Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}